{"reviewId": "386397050_89gf8R0yJ", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "朱格拉周期（企业设备周期）\n一句话：10年一轮，看企业要不要换新机器、扩产、搞生产。\n核心：企业的集体行为，不是人买房，是老板们要不要花钱搞生产。\n简单过程\n1. 经济好、订单多 → 老板们集体疯狂买机器、建厂、扩产（繁荣）\n2. 机器买太多、货生产太多卖不掉 → 产能过剩、降价内卷（衰退）\n3. 老板亏钱、裁员、不买新机器、老机器凑合用（萧条）\n4. 老机器坏得差不多了，必须换新 → 新一轮开始\n三个周期一句话对比\n• 康波60年：一代人一辈子，国运大轮回\n• 库兹涅茨20年：一代人买房，房地产周期\n• 朱格拉10年：企业换机器，制造业周期\n结合你那句金句\n周期都是人的集体行为\n• 康波：几代人敢不敢花钱、敢不敢冒险\n• 库兹涅茨：年轻人买不买房\n• 朱格拉：老板们敢不敢花钱买设备、扩产", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "3517-3522", "abstract": "朱格拉周期", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "386397050_89gf8R0yJ", "userVid": 386397050, "topics": [], "createTime": 1779338053, "userEditTime": 1779338145, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 386397050, "name": "莓泥不行ʸᵃ", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0005-E2mU4xBLISZsua7EyhJMC10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "莓泥不行ʸᵃ", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M9-0-5", "desc": "阅读神作", "title": "神作研习生", "levelIndex": 5}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 144, "likes": [{"userVid": 356811058, "name": "朱晓维", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTI0X4qAiaB04kqRhkvWIyLKBibbfyM2uibdc3I76uHOrC62Lkuz4Q9SFUDjaqwcvlwDCrC0WUKib3EQRw/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M12-0-0-E-0-0-0", "desc": "世界读书日", "title": "世界读